  "question": {
    "text": "If force <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo></math> length <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and time <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> be considered fundamental units, then the units of mass will be"
